+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold, setting only `id`, `title` and
+     `status` (and any `--tags` or `--set` value). Fill the required frontmatter fields and replace
+     these placeholder comments yourself; `wingfoil memory submit` then checks the required fields,
+     moves `status` forward and commits the document as you left it, naming in the commit body the
+     content it carries. -->
+
+`cancel(bookingId, at)` cancels a booking at the time `at` (ISO-8601 UTC string) and returns
+`{ bookingId, refund }`, the refund in integer euro cents. Policy (from task-001): full refund of the booking
+total when `at` is at least 24h before the booking's start; no refund (0) when `at` is less than 24h before
+start, or after it. A cancelled booking no longer holds its equipment (it is free again for booking and
+availability). A booking can be cancelled only once; an unknown booking id, an invalid `at`, or a second
+cancellation throws.
